ntent":"I just tried, but I’m still unable to send MMS messages. What should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:48.262735","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":15,"usage":{"completion_tokens":22,"prompt_tokens":2468}},{"content":"Thank you for trying again. To continue troubleshooting, I’ll need your help to check a few settings on your phone. \n\nFirst, could you please check if your mobile data is enabled and that you have a good signal? On your phone, look at the status bar at the top of your screen and let me know:\n- If you see any signal bars (and how many)\n- If you see a mobile data icon (like 4G, LTE, 5G, etc.)\n- If Airplane Mode is on\n\nThis will help us determine if your phone is connected to the network and if mobile data is available, which are both required for MMS.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":16,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:50.299816","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":16,"usage":{"completion_tokens":136,"prompt_tokens":7026}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:51.755054","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_ydoTPHdsoZk7LcKrdo5cTorZ","name":"check_status_bar","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":17,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2630}},{"content":"Status Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:51.755264","tool_call_id":"call_ydoTPHdsoZk7LcKrdo5cTorZ","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":18,"usage":null},{"content":"Looking at my status bar, I see excellent signal strength, the 5G icon, and mobile data is enabled. Airplane Mode is not on. What should I check next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:52.959190","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":19,"usage":{"completion_tokens":39,"prompt_tokens":2671}},{"content":"Great, your signal and mobile data look good. Next, let's check if your phone's APN (Access Point Name) settings are correct, as incorrect APN settings are a common cause of MMS issues.\n\nPlease check your APN settings and let me know if you see an MMSC (Multimedia Messaging Service Center) URL listed. If you’re not sure how to check, I can guide you through the steps. Would you like instructions on how to check your APN and MMSC settings?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:54.526521","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":20,"usage":{"completion_tokens":103,"prompt_tokens":7205}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":21,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:55.405726","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_2kWN399g6MDckz31ohESSiGp","name":"check_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":21,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":2817}},{"content":"Current APN Name: internet\nMMSC URL (for picture messages): http://mms.carrier.com/mms/wapenc\n(These are technical settings, usually best left unchanged.)","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":22,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:55.406040","tool_call_id":"call_2kWN399g6MDckz31ohESSiGp","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":22,"usage":null},{"content":"I checked my APN settings, and the APN name is set to \"internet\" with the MMSC URL listed as \"http://mms.carrier.com/mms/wapenc.\" Does that look correct, or should I change anything?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":23,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:56.459998","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":23,"usage":{"completion_tokens":52,"prompt_tokens":2876}},{"content":"Thank you for providing your APN and MMSC details. The settings you provided appear to be standard, but sometimes issues can still occur if there are hidden errors or if the settings need to be refreshed.\n\nThe next recommended step is to reset your APN settings to default. After resetting, you should reboot your device for the changes to take effect.\n\nWould you like instructions on how to reset your APN settings and reboot your device, or are you comfortable performing these steps on your own?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":24,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:58.045743","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":24,"usage":{"completion_tokens":100,"prompt_tokens":7364}},{"content":"I’m comfortable resetting the APN settings and rebooting my device. I’ll go ahead and do that now.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":25,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:49:59.247347","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_sW8L9qugkbrUbhhtTMLYaatD","name":"reset_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":25,"usage":{"complet